/* ============================================================================
   PORTAL SHELL
   The frame every page in the redesigned portal lives inside. Geometry is a
   contract rather than a per-page decision:

     rail 16rem (collapsed 4.75rem) · top bar 3.5rem · content max 90rem
     gutters 1rem / 1.5rem / 1.75rem · section rhythm from the Phase 2 rule

   The rail state persists, the palette is global, and on a phone the primary
